'''Regionals''' is the second episode of ''[[Pokémon: Path to the Peak]]''. It was first released on the official English Pokémon [[YouTube]] channel on August 16, 2023.
{{spoilers}}

==Blurb==
<i>With a battle against Celestine looming, Ava rises to the challenge and enters to compete at the Regional Championships.</i>

==Plot==
[[Ava]] falls asleep while building a deck to defeat [[Celestine]], and has a nightmare about her {{p|Oddish}} being attacked by {{type|Ghost}} Pokémon, most notably a {{p|Mismagius}} bearing Celestine's face. When she wakes up, {{OBP|Joshua|Path to the Peak}} and other members of the school's Pokémon club offer her encouragement outside her house, as the [[World Championships|Regional Championships]] are later that day. Ava's mother tries to tell her something before she goes, but drops the topic, and Ava's father drives Ava and Joshua to the championship venue.

At the venue, Celestine attempts to intimidate Ava on multiple occasions, even defeating [[Ava's father]] in a [[Pokémon Trading Card Game|TCG]] match in front of her. Regardless, Ava maintains her determination.

For her first TCG match at the venue, Ava faces a player named {{OBP|Tonio|Path to the Peak}}, who uses a {{p|Bidoof}}. She defeats him and several other players, and eventually reaches Celestine, the reigning regional champion, in the final match.

Celestine wins the first game and Ava wins the second, leaving the third game to decide the match. Ava and Celestine play a close game, with both players eventually having one prize card left, and Celestine's Mismagius ready to finish off Ava's {{p|Gloom}}. Ava uses the card effect of her {{p|Spoink}} to draw a {{p|Vileplume}} card, uses that to evolve her Gloom, and uses Vileplume's attack, which only succeeds if a {{OBP|coin|TCG}} lands on heads. The coin flip is successful, and Ava wins the game and the match, earning the title of regional champion.

Celestine thanks Ava for the thrilling match, and Ava, Celestine, Joshua, and Tonio take a group picture together.

==Major events==
* Ava defeats Celestine, and takes the title of regional champion.

